QUICK REFERENCE: FILES ON A kubeadm CONTROL PLANE
-------------------------------------------------
  /etc/kubernetes/manifests/*.yaml   static pods
  /etc/kubernetes/pki/               certificates
  /etc/kubernetes/admin.conf         admin kubeconfig
  /etc/kubernetes/kubelet.conf       kubelet's kubeconfig
  /var/lib/kubelet/config.yaml       kubelet configuration
  /var/lib/etcd/                     etcd data
  /etc/containerd/config.toml        runtime config
  journalctl -u kubelet / containerd logs


